The scripting folder contains documentation for multiple programming languages (JavaScript, Lua, Python, TypeScript) that can be used to extend the client's functionality through user scripts, plugins, and automation. These scripts provide access to APIs for terminal output, HTTP requests, global variables, and browser-based automation, allowing users to create custom aliases, triggers, timers, and in-game actions. The folder serves as a centralized reference for implementing custom scripting solutions within the project's client environment.
